    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, when you use a non-attack pattern <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a>, you grant all ships in your squadron the ability to use the same <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a> once on their next turn. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a> of each ship that chooses to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a> must make any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> checks or attack rolls the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a> requires- your success or failure with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a> has no bearing on the success of other units in your squadron.",
